[{"ave_id":"AVE-2025-0040","file_name":"2025/AVE-2025-0040.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2025-8693","title":"Zyxel DX3300-T0 操作系统命令注入漏洞","description":"Zyxel DX3300-T0 固件版本 5.50(ABVY.6.3)C0 及之前版本存在操作系统命令注入漏洞，经过认证的攻击者可通过向 CGI 程序的 \"priv\" 参数注入恶意操作系统命令，在目标设备上以 root 权限执行任意命令。该漏洞允许攻击者完全控制受影响设备，危害等级高（CVSS 8.8），建议用户立即升级至修复版本。","severity":"HIGH","score":8.8,"aliases":["CVE-2025-8693"],"sources":["hwpoc"],"published":"2025-11-18T02:15:45.410","updated":"2026-06-17T10:07:27.083","remediation":"立即将 Zyxel DX3300-T0 固件升级至 5.50(ABVY.6.4)C0 或更高版本（联系 Zyxel 技术支持获取固件文件）。如无法立即升级，确保设备 WAN 访问保持默认关闭状态，并设置强密码且定期更换，防止攻击者通过认证后利用 priv 参数注入操作系统命令。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-20T00:00:00Z","references":["https://www.zyxel.com/global/en/support/security-advisories/zyxel-security-advisory-for-uncontrolled-resource-consumption-and-command-injection-vulnerabilities-in-certain-4g-lte-5g-nr-cpe-dsl-ethernet-cpe-fiber-onts-security-routers-and-wireless-extenders-11-18-2025","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/24df5d59670dfe04b9c86de11fa86df63c0d28f7/cves/2025/8xxx/CVE-2025-8693.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/6ce62c4fb53e185987a087a07544538a62587799/2025/8xxx/CVE-2025-8693.json","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/470a5f1c0d1bd36cd0a6327cda49cf96a1474588/content/CVE-2025-8693.md","https://github.com/3kz2501/3kz_blog/blob/b547e7e64a92ccf9b100bfc2bc6b038613fd13a7/app/routes/posts/2025-11-18_CVE-2025-8693.mdx","https://github.com/adysec/hwpoc/blob/7f9d328c5fbc6b96e5e86ea6c9dab85e4e384533/docs/2026/Zyxel_DX3300-T0_%E6%93%8D%E4%BD%9C%E7%B3%BB%E7%BB%9F%E5%91%BD%E4%BB%A4%E6%B3%A8%E5%85%A5%E6%BC%8F%E6%B4%9E_CVE-2025-8693.toml","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/4544d3857250fe21711ce8febf38e8822729678f/advisories/unreviewed/2025/11/GHSA-jvj8-73h8-vqf9/GHSA-jvj8-73h8-vqf9.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/228df6a85079f5c6b1ecdfb3d41be685458438ef/SSVC/data/2025/CVE-2025-8693.json","https://github.com/xhls008/nvd_yesterday/blob/d2db0569df181d5506cd0b443d26007c2bff1c8a/CVEs_log/2025-11-19_zh.md","https://github.com/wooluo/vuln_crawler/blob/d6b8c0f3c049bc3b4d8d2295343fd57cd045bab9/vulnerability_reports/vulnerability_report_2025-11-19_09-29-24.md","https://github.com/Vulnogram/Vulnogram.github.io/blob/8217b89fdf690dcc563cba34f021c6fbb19c3935/rss/zyxel.xml","https://nvd.nist.gov/vuln/detail/CVE-2025-8693"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2025/POC-AVE-2025-0040.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2025/AVE-2025-0040.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2025-0349","file_name":"2025/AVE-2025-0349.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2025-61670","title":"Bytecode Alliance Wasmtime C/C++ API 内存泄漏漏洞","description":"Wasmtime 是一个 WebAssembly 运行时，其在 37.0.0 和 37.0.1 版本中存在 C/C++ API 内存泄漏漏洞。由于开发过程中将 `ManuallyRooted<T>` 重构为 `OwnedRooted<T>` 类型时未正确集成到 C/C++ API 中，导致 `externref` 和 `anyref` 类型的宿主内存分配无法在 store 销毁时自动释放。C API 中的 `wasmtime_val_unroot` 函数因拼写错误实际无效，C++ API 缺少析构函数处理，以及宿主函数返回值未被取消根引用，共同导致持续内存泄漏。使用 C/C++ API 处理 `externref` 或 `anyref` 值的应用会累积泄漏宿主内存，长期运行可能导致拒绝服务。该漏洞不影响 Rust crate 及未使用相关类型的嵌入场景。已在 37.0.2 版本修复。","severity":"LOW","score":1.0,"aliases":["CVE-2025-61670","GHSA-vvp9-h8p2-xwfc"],"sources":["ghsa"],"published":"2025-10-07T19:15:38.780","updated":"2026-06-17T09:50:45.227","remediation":"升级至 Wasmtime 37.0.2 或更高版本，该版本已修复 `wasmtime_val_unroot` 函数未真正取消根对象的缺陷，并为 C++ API 的 `ExternRef`、`AnyRef` 和 `Val` 类型添加了析构函数。如无法立即升级，应避免在 C/C++ API 中使用 `externref` 和 `anyref` 类型，以消除内存泄漏风险。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["https://github.com/bytecodealliance/wasmtime/commit/adff9d9d0f09569203709d5687e5a7dc8e1ad0a3","https://github.com/bytecodealliance/wasmtime/releases/tag/v37.0.2","https://github.com/bytecodealliance/wasmtime/security/advisories/GHSA-vvp9-h8p2-xwfc","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/3ffa2a96db84a89f71e1c7ad889e5f4fcc755a48/2025/CVE-2025-61670.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/4e452a37e644e8194f1171b7eec1f7dc625b6526/cves/2025/61xxx/CVE-2025-61670.json","https://github.com/Tabll/gemnasium-db/blob/de1cbf8802a4c6060caaa5924b50812f2a62fead/pypi/wasmtime-bin/CVE-2025-61670.yml","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/6d175f59444084675ba336cc9e2bc51fc5338e6d/2025/61xxx/CVE-2025-61670.json","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/2025/CVE-2025-61670.md","https://github.com/pypa/advisory-database/blob/b9b8f76bfb92e30a50d8f60d2d06a8800347fe9d/vulns/wasmtime-bin/PYSEC-2025-268.yaml","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/d880529b2028116bddf6c732baf8f599b169f01e/SSVC/data/2025/CVE-2025-61670.json","https://github.com/NovyWave/NovyWave/blob/c8d16adfe96205549bd43ebfe13781fce00f266a/.claude/extra/project/specs/plugins.md","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/1721417c5dc7c1cbf858e5ea5a5245ea62e70cce/advisories/github-reviewed/2026/07/GHSA-vvp9-h8p2-xwfc/GHSA-vvp9-h8p2-xwfc.json","https://github.com/maxgfr/package-checker.sh/blob/70b8af273b1d73af5c372b20593b139dc1165787/data/osv-cargo.purl"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2025/AVE-2025-0349.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2025-0099","file_name":"2025/AVE-2025-0099.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2025-48703","title":"CWP CentOS Web Panel filemanager 远程代码执行漏洞","description":"CWP（Control Web Panel，又称 CentOS Web Panel）0.9.8.1205 之前版本的文件管理器模块中存在 OS 命令注入漏洞。远程攻击者在已知一个有效非 root 用户名的情况下，可通过向 /myuser/index.php?module=filemanager&acc=changePerm 端点发送特制请求，在 t_total 参数中注入 shell 元字符执行任意系统命令，导致未经身份认证的远程代码执行。该漏洞影响大量使用 CWP 面板的 CentOS 服务器，CVSS 评分 9.0，危害等级严重。厂商已在 0.9.8.1205 版本中修复此漏洞。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":9.0,"aliases":["CVE-2025-48703"],"sources":["hwpoc"],"published":"2025-09-19T18:15:36.620","updated":"2026-06-17T09:30:12.133","remediation":"立即将 Control Web Panel (CWP) 升级至 0.9.8.1205 或更高版本。升级命令：`sh <(curl -fsSL https://control-web-panel.com/install/update.sh)`。如无法立即升级，可在 Web 服务器（Apache/Nginx）层面配置访问控制，限制 `/myuser/index.php` 路径仅允许可信 IP 访问，并删除或限制 `filemanager` 模块的未授权调用权限。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-20T00:00:00Z","references":["https://fenrisk.com/rce-centos-webpanel","https://control-webpanel.com/changelog","https://www.cisa.gov/known-exploited-vulnerabilities-catalog?field_cve=CVE-2025-48703","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/http/cves/2025/CVE-2025-48703.yaml","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/b4f1378756fd26f414d09a97dc81126672830951/2025/CVE-2025-48703.md","https://github.com/nomi-sec/PoC-in-GitHub/blob/f8a21b0c30953d5926478bb080c200645e84a23a/2025/CVE-2025-48703.json","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/010b0aa4fab18a47a1dfa699acc027ecfea23b55/http/cves/2025/CVE-2025-48703.yaml","https://github.com/arschlochnop/VulnWatchdog/blob/a7fcebc1b9e9a88d443be844dae279be54e22ef4/data/2025/CVE-2025-48703-Sq-CC_CVE-2025-48703.md","https://github.com/wooluo/nuclei-templates-2025hw/blob/37e9617426e2a696c8c338b15df99abd6294a4eb/cve-2025-48703.yaml","https://github.com/rix4uni/cvemapping/blob/aaa966adf56b88bf2eba7f47ee24a777c6208719/2025/CVE-2025-48703/README.md","https://github.com/ARPSyndicate/suricata-vedas/blob/fe24794ad36564b5bbc7c69101525011387b8650/2025/CVE-2025-48703.rules","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/d00c4bdddf18e05c46df568e8ae91e7912ce321c/cves/2025/48xxx/CVE-2025-48703.json","https://github.com/cloudflare/cloudflare-docs/blob/6ca38245cd4f76ea240e519a68d43bb56ac01013/src/content/changelog/waf/2025-08-04-waf-release.mdx","https://github.com/cyberdudebivash/cyberdudebivash-ai-security-hub/blob/13403e1745f63237e7ef6d51562fb36112320d77/frontend/cve/CVE-2025-48703.html","https://github.com/Skynoxk/CVE-2025-48703","https://github.com/itstarsec/CVE-2025-48703","https://nvd.nist.gov/vuln/detail/CVE-2025-48703"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2025/AVE-2025-0099.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2025-0008","file_name":"2025/AVE-2025-0008.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2025-10035","title":"Fortra GoAnywhere MFT 许可证 Servlet 反序列化命令注入漏洞","description":"Fortra GoAnywhere MFT 的许可证 Servlet（License Servlet）存在不安全的反序列化漏洞。由于该组件在验证许可证响应时仅依赖可被合法伪造的签名，具备有效伪造签名的攻击者能够构造并反序列化由攻击者完全控制的任意对象，进而在服务器端触发命令注入，实现远程代码执行。该漏洞影响运行 Fortra GoAnywhere MFT 的相关版本，攻击者可经网络远程利用，无需身份认证即可通过特制的许可证响应请求达成利用，CVSS 评分为 10.0，危害等级为严重。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":10.0,"aliases":["CVE-2025-10035"],"sources":["hwpoc"],"published":"2025-09-18T22:15:41.857","updated":"2026-06-17T08:27:33.740","remediation":"立即将 GoAnywhere MFT 升级至 7.6.3 或 7.8.4 及以上版本以修复 License Servlet 反序列化漏洞。升级前请确认许可证响应签名验证机制已正确配置，升级后重启 License Servlet 服务。若暂无法升级，建议在防火墙层面限制对 License Servlet 路径的访问，仅允许可信 IP 访问，并监控异常出站连接作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-19T00:00:00Z","references":["https://www.fortra.com/security/advisories/product-security/fi-2025-012","https://www.cisa.gov/known-exploited-vulnerabilities-catalog?field_cve=CVE-2025-10035","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/http/cves/2025/CVE-2025-10035.yaml","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/b4f1378756fd26f414d09a97dc81126672830951/2025/CVE-2025-10035.md","https://github.com/nomi-sec/PoC-in-GitHub/blob/c2672e36893bd220d6f65c955e260796d11ed64b/2025/CVE-2025-10035.json","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/010b0aa4fab18a47a1dfa699acc027ecfea23b55/http/cves/2025/CVE-2025-10035.yaml","https://github.com/SigmaHQ/sigma/blob/bc433784ede7dbd633c8f5b318929cce6dea621a/rules-emerging-threats/2025/Exploits/CVE-2025-10035/proc_creation_win_exploit_cve_2025_10035.yml","https://github.com/arschlochnop/VulnWatchdog/blob/9e669818e6334d592d44717c5ec3d75ca4cc97e4/data/2025/CVE-2025-10035-rxerium_CVE-2025-10035.md","https://github.com/vuldb/cyber_threat_intelligence/blob/6a5017307e035c2b54c7afbe3bd8582497eafa96/campaigns/c/CVE-2025-10035/README.md","https://github.com/ARPSyndicate/suricata-vedas/blob/fe24794ad36564b5bbc7c69101525011387b8650/2025/CVE-2025-10035.rules","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/dde4d96d7c1eff197b9a15817af615500736afa7/cves/2025/10xxx/CVE-2025-10035.json","https://github.com/cloudflare/cloudflare-docs/blob/6ca38245cd4f76ea240e519a68d43bb56ac01013/src/content/changelog/waf/2025-09-24-emergency-waf-release.mdx","https://github.com/hack007x/veil_poc/blob/5cfe1da6e975ba816d728597885a5c5e79bda8bd/cves/2025/CVE-2025-10035.poc","https://github.com/rxerium/CVE-2025-10035","https://github.com/ThemeHackers/CVE-2025-10035","https://github.com/sentinel-aidefense/CVE-2025-10035","https://github.com/orange0Mint/CVE-2025-10035_GoAnywhere","https://nvd.nist.gov/vuln/detail/CVE-2025-10035"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2025/AVE-2025-0008.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2025-0290","file_name":"2025/AVE-2025-0290.toml","cve_id":"无","title":"用友 NC baplink SQL注入漏洞","description":"用友 NC 企业管理系统 baplink 接口存在 SQL 注入漏洞。攻击者可向 /portal/pt/baplink/content 发送特制 GET 请求，在 pk_funnode 参数中注入恶意 SQL 语句，在无需登录认证的情况下读取或篡改数据库敏感信息。该漏洞影响对外开放相关接口的用友 NC 部署，攻击门槛低、远程可利用，可能导致核心业务数据泄露。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["HWPOC-2025-050ac444"],"sources":["hwpoc"],"published":"2025-07-30","updated":"2025-07-30","remediation":"联系用友官方获取并安装针对 baplink 接口的安全补丁或升级至已修复版本。在应用代码中对 pk_funnode 等入参改为参数化查询或预编译语句，禁止字符串拼接 SQL。临时可在 WAF 或反向代理拦截 /portal/pt/baplink/content 路径中含单引号、UNION、SELECT、updatexml 等注入特征的请求，并限制该接口仅内网可信 IP 访问。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-20T00:00:00Z","references":["https://www.yonyou.com","https://security.yonyou.com"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2025/AVE-2025-0290.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2025-0262","file_name":"2025/AVE-2025-0262.toml","cve_id":"无","title":"时空智友 企业流程化管控系统 XML外部实体注入漏洞","description":"时空智友企业流程化管控系统存在XML外部实体注入漏洞，由于系统在处理XML数据时未对外部实体进行有效过滤，攻击者可通过POST请求向/formservice接口发送特制的XML载荷，利用XXE漏洞读取服务器敏感文件或发起内部网络请求。该漏洞影响时空智友企业流程化管控系统多个版本，攻击者无需认证即可远程利用，危害较大。建议厂商及时修复XML解析器配置，禁用外部实体解析。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["HWPOC-2025-047ee81c"],"sources":["hwpoc"],"published":"2025-07-29","updated":"2025-07-29","remediation":"修改XML解析器配置，禁用DTD外部实体解析（在Java中设置DocumentBuilderFactory的setFeature(\"http://apache.org/xml/features/disallow-doctype-decl\", true)或在.NET中设置XmlReaderSettings的ProhibitDtd = true）。对/formservice接口的POST请求体进行严格校验，过滤XML实体声明。联系厂商获取安全更新，限制服务器出站访问以缓解SSRF风险。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-20T00:00:00Z","references":[],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2025/AVE-2025-0262.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2025-0189","file_name":"2025/AVE-2025-0189.toml","cve_id":"无","title":"红帆OA NetCAUserLogin.aspx SQL注入漏洞","description":"红帆OA（iOffice）办公自动化系统的 NetCAUserLogin.aspx 登录页面存在SQL注入漏洞。该页面在验证用户身份时，将用户输入的账号参数直接拼接到SQL查询语句中，未进行参数化处理或特殊字符过滤。攻击者无需任何身份认证，只需向该页面发送包含恶意SQL语句的HTTP请求，即可构造 UNION 查询提取数据库中的敏感信息，或利用 SQL 盲注绕过登录验证获取管理员权限。该漏洞影响使用该页面的所有红帆OA系统版本，攻击条件简单，危害较大。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["HWPOC-2025-02baa738"],"sources":["hwpoc"],"published":"2025-07-29","updated":"2025-07-29","remediation":"联系红帆科技获取官方安全补丁并升级至最新版本；修改 NetCAUserLogin.aspx 页面代码，将字符串拼接方式改为参数化查询，对账号和密码参数过滤单引号、分号、-- 注释符等特殊字符；如无法立即升级，可在Web应用防火墙上配置规则拦截包含 UNION、SELECT、OR 1=1 等SQL注入特征的HTTP请求。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-20T00:00:00Z","references":["https://hwpoc.org/vuln/detail/HWPOC-2025-02baa738"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2025/AVE-2025-0189.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2025-0083","file_name":"2025/AVE-2025-0083.toml","cve_id":"无","title":"孚盟云 GetImage.aspx SQL注入漏洞","description":"孚盟云（Fox Cloud）系统 GetImage.aspx 页面存在 SQL 注入漏洞，未授权的远程攻击者可通过向该页面传递特制的请求参数注入恶意 SQL 语句，从而绕过身份认证获取数据库中的敏感信息，包括管理员凭据及业务数据。攻击者无需登录即可利用该漏洞，攻击门槛低、危害性较大，建议用户及时升级修复。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["HWPOC-2025-00ce201b"],"sources":["hwpoc"],"published":"2025-07-25","updated":"2026-07-20","remediation":"建议联系上海孚盟软件官方获取修复补丁或升级至最新版本，同时在Web应用防火墙上配置SQL注入防护规则，对GetImage.aspx页面的所有输入参数实施严格的参数化查询处理和输入过滤。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-20T00:00:00Z","references":[],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2025/AVE-2025-0083.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2025-0174","file_name":"2025/AVE-2025-0174.toml","cve_id":"无","title":"用友NMC服务任意文件上传漏洞","description":"用友网络管理中心（NMC）服务存在严重的任意文件上传漏洞，攻击者可通过向该服务发送精心构造的HTTP请求上传恶意文件，并结合文件包含或命令执行等二次漏洞实现远程代码执行。该漏洞影响用友旗下多款网络管理中心软件，受害主机涵盖大量企事业单位。攻击者无需身份验证即可触发漏洞，只要目标系统开放了NMC服务即可利用。该漏洞可导致企业核心数据泄露、系统瘫痪及关键业务中断，危害严重。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["HWPOC-2025-027c9084"],"sources":["hwpoc"],"published":"2025-07-23","updated":"2025-07-23","remediation":"联系用友官方获取安全修复补丁并升级NMC服务至最新版本；在升级前使用Web应用防火墙（WAF）拦截对文件上传接口的恶意请求，限制NMC服务仅对可信内网IP开放，关闭不必要的文件写入目录执行权限以缓解风险。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-20T00:00:00Z","references":[],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2025/AVE-2025-0174.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2025-0032","file_name":"2025/AVE-2025-0032.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2025-51482","title":"Letta AI代理框架 远程代码执行漏洞","description":"Letta AI代理框架（letta-ai Letta 0.7.12及之前版本）的 `/v1/tools/run` 接口存在代码注入漏洞（CWE-94）。由于服务端对用户提交的 `source_code` 参数缺乏有效的沙箱隔离与输入验证，远程攻击者可通过向该接口发送特制的JSON请求，注入恶意Python代码并利用 `os.popen` 等函数执行任意系统命令，从而完全控制目标服务器。该漏洞无需身份认证即可利用，CVSS评分8.8，危害等级高。","severity":"HIGH","score":8.8,"aliases":["CVE-2025-51482"],"sources":["hwpoc"],"published":"2025-07-22T17:15:33.750","updated":"2026-06-17T09:35:37.930","remediation":"升级至 Letta 最新版本（≥v0.16.8），该版本已通过 JSON 序列化替代 pickle 传输、模块白名单机制、E2B 沙箱集成等多层加固修复工具执行端点的代码注入漏洞。如无法立即升级，应立即执行以下缓解措施：（1）在反向代理（Nginx/Cloudflare）层面限制 `/v1/tools/run` 端点仅允许受信来源 IP 访问；（2）将 Letta 容器以非 root 用户运行（如 UID 1000）并启用 `--read-only` 只读文件系统；（3）在配置中启用 E2B 外部沙箱（设置 `E2B_API_KEY`）替代默认的本地目录沙箱执行工具代码，阻止任意系统命令执行。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-20T00:00:00Z","references":["https://github.com/letta-ai/letta","https://github.com/letta-ai/letta/pull/2630","https://www.gecko.security/blog/cve-2025-51482","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/http/cves/2025/CVE-2025-51482.yaml","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/b4f1378756fd26f414d09a97dc81126672830951/2025/CVE-2025-51482.md","https://github.com/nomi-sec/PoC-in-GitHub/blob/f8a21b0c30953d5926478bb080c200645e84a23a/2025/CVE-2025-51482.json","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/d09fb918849614ec417315b66ba20a16a39f16a4/http/cves/2025/CVE-2025-51482.yaml","https://github.com/SourByte05/Vulnerability-Wiki-PoC/blob/e52a2c3eaf2fb0befc721cf0919d07ea435a23b4/2025/Letta-CVE-2025-51482-%E4%BB%A3%E7%A0%81%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C/Letta-CVE-2025-51482-%E4%BB%A3%E7%A0%81%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C.md","https://github.com/gelusus/wxvl/blob/0190a57b50c784bda47a3b9ac049eaf5bb577d6e/doc/2026-01/Letta%20%E4%BB%A3%E7%A0%81%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C%E6%BC%8F%E6%B4%9E%20(CVE-2025-51482).md","https://github.com/arschlochnop/VulnWatchdog/blob/a7fcebc1b9e9a88d443be844dae279be54e22ef4/data/2025/CVE-2025-51482-Kai-One001_Letta-CVE-2025-51482-RCE.md","https://github.com/ARPSyndicate/suricata-vedas/blob/fe24794ad36564b5bbc7c69101525011387b8650/2025/CVE-2025-51482.rules","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/30c3a896d257362f7419b0c772be2f3dd063ccaa/cves/2025/51xxx/CVE-2025-51482.json","https://github.com/rix4uni/cvemapping/blob/aaa966adf56b88bf2eba7f47ee24a777c6208719/2025/CVE-2025-51482/README.md","https://github.com/hack007x/veil_poc/blob/5cfe1da6e975ba816d728597885a5c5e79bda8bd/cves/2025/CVE-2025-51482.poc","https://github.com/Kai-One001/Letta-CVE-2025-51482-RCE","https://github.com/c0gnit00/CVE-2024-51482","https://nvd.nist.gov/vuln/detail/CVE-2025-51482"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2025/POC-AVE-2025-0032.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2025/EXP-AVE-2025-0032.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2025/AVE-2025-0032.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2025-0199","file_name":"2025/AVE-2025-0199.toml","cve_id":"无","title":"东胜物流软件 FileExport.aspx 任意文件读取漏洞","description":"东胜物流软件 FileExport.aspx 接口存在任意文件读取漏洞，攻击者可在未授权的情况下通过构造特制的文件路径参数，利用路径遍历技术读取服务器上的任意文件，包括配置文件、数据库连接信息等敏感数据。该漏洞影响东胜物流软件多个版本，攻击者只需网络可达即可利用，危害较大。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["HWPOC-2025-02e3a462"],"sources":["hwpoc"],"published":"2025-07-22","updated":"2025-07-22","remediation":"联系东胜软件厂商获取最新安全补丁，升级至修复该漏洞的版本。如无法立即升级，在 Web 服务器（IIS）中对 FileExport.aspx 页面添加 IP 白名单访问控制，仅允许可信内网 IP 访问；同时在代码层对传入的文件路径参数进行严格校验，禁止包含 ../ 等路径遍历字符，并将可读取路径限制在指定上传目录内。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-20T00:00:00Z","references":[],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2025/AVE-2025-0199.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2025-0131","file_name":"2025/AVE-2025-0131.toml","cve_id":"无","title":"Jeecg-Boot SQL 注入漏洞","description":"Jeecg-Boot 是一款基于代码生成器的 Java 快速开发框架。其某些接口存在 SQL 注入漏洞，未授权的攻击者可通过构造恶意请求参数，在数据库查询中注入任意 SQL 语句，导致敏感数据泄露、数据篡改甚至远程代码执行。攻击者无需身份认证即可利用该漏洞。\n","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["HWPOC-2025-01cc2a3a"],"sources":["hwpoc"],"published":"2025-07-21","updated":"2025-07-21","remediation":"升级 Jeecg-boot 至 3.5.3 或更高版本，该版本修复了相关 SQL 注入漏洞。如无法升级，建议对用户输入参数进行严格的过滤和参数化查询处理。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-20T00:00:00Z","references":[],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2025/AVE-2025-0131.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2025-0100","file_name":"2025/AVE-2025-0100.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2025-53770","title":"Microsoft SharePoint Server 远程代码执行漏洞","description":"Microsoft SharePoint Server 本地部署版本中的 ToolShell 组件存在反序列化漏洞（CWE-502），未经身份认证的攻击者可通过网络向目标系统发送特制的恶意请求触发该漏洞，成功利用可在目标服务器上远程执行任意代码。该漏洞 CVSS 评分 9.8，危害严重，且已有公开的利用代码在野传播。Microsoft 建议用户在官方安全更新发布前立即启用缓解措施以防止被利用。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":9.8,"aliases":["CVE-2025-53770"],"sources":["hwpoc"],"published":"2025-07-20T01:15:30.777","updated":"2026-06-17T09:38:51.660","remediation":"Microsoft 尚未发布针对 CVE-2025-53770 的正式安全更新，作为临时缓解措施：1）在 SharePoint 管理中心启用 AMSI（反恶意软件扫描接口）集成，并在所有 SharePoint 服务器上部署 Microsoft Defender 防病毒和 EDR 方案；2）使用 PowerShell 执行 Set-SPMachineKey 和 Update-SPMachineKey 轮换 ASP.NET 计算机密钥，然后运行 iisreset.exe 重启 IIS；3）无法启用 AMSI 时应立即将面向公网的 SharePoint 服务器断网隔离；4）审查 IIS 日志中是否存在 Referer 为 /_layouts/SignOut.aspx 且 POST 至 /_layouts/15/ToolPane.aspx 的可疑请求。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-20T00:00:00Z","references":["https://msrc.microsoft.com/update-guide/vulnerability/CVE-2025-53770","https://arstechnica.com/security/2025/07/sharepoint-vulnerability-with-9-8-severity-rating-is-under-exploit-across-the-globe/","https://github.com/kaizensecurity/CVE-2025-53770","https://msrc.microsoft.com/blog/2025/07/customer-guidance-for-sharepoint-vulnerability-cve-2025-53770/","https://news.ycombinator.com/item?id=44629710","https://research.eye.security/sharepoint-under-siege/","https://therecord.media/microsoft-sharepoint-zero-day-vulnerability-exploited-globally","https://www.bleepingcomputer.com/news/microsoft/microsoft-sharepoint-zero-day-exploited-in-rce-attacks-no-patch-available/","https://www.cisa.gov/news-events/alerts/2025/07/20/microsoft-releases-guidance-exploitation-sharepoint-vulnerability-cve-2025-53770","https://www.darkreading.com/remote-workforce/microsoft-rushes-emergency-fix-exploited-sharepoint-toolshell-flaw","https://www.forbes.com/sites/daveywinder/2025/07/20/microsoft-confirms-ongoing-mass-sharepoint-attack---no-patch-available/","https://x.com/Shadowserver/status/1946900837306868163","https://www.cisa.gov/known-exploited-vulnerabilities-catalog?field_cve=CVE-2025-53770","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/52405","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/http/cves/2025/CVE-2025-53770.yaml","https://github.com/J4ck3LSyN-Gen2/CVE-2025-53770","https://github.com/0xMarcio/cve/blob/3b956963db597dfc3808b14bb6c1e0feecc70f0a/2025/CVE-2025-53770.md","https://github.com/CrowdStrike/logscale-community-content/blob/970f85669d8ec0fe07e65f13f7120fbbc26a1bb5/Queries-Only/Helpful-CQL-Queries/CVE-2025-53770%20-%20SharePoint%20ToolShell.md","https://github.com/lal0ne/vulnerability/blob/5b9f397c1970203b1764fb7a66a0ffac39bef4cc/Microsoft/CVE-2025-53770/README.md","https://github.com/zan8in/afrog/blob/2f4b82909698139f3589d577b113dd4e51dc5c96/pocs/afrog-pocs/CVE/2025/CVE-2025-53770.yaml","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/b4f1378756fd26f414d09a97dc81126672830951/2025/CVE-2025-49706.md","https://github.com/k8gege/k8gege.github.io/blob/0562c0ddc0b76d93df268fcb4feea3f97fa3589d/p/cve-2025-53770.html","https://github.com/arschlochnop/VulnWatchdog/blob/a7fcebc1b9e9a88d443be844dae279be54e22ef4/data/2025/CVE-2025-53770-n1chr0x_ZeroPoint.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/d0a8c476da89b37a2bbb6193b7964b10d03aff75/CVE/data/2025/CVE-2025-53770.json","https://github.com/Neo23x0/signature-base/blob/43b2b2faafdaeb7f00102673f62555a2feb04c1b/yara/expl_sharepoint_jul25.yar","https://github.com/Threekiii/CVE/blob/b15267648d6c329465c8b4cfbeb7597850ead8c1/2025/2025.07/CVE-2025-53770%EF%BC%9AMicrosoft%20SharePoint%20Server%20%E8%BF%9C%E7%A8%8B%E4%BB%A3%E7%A0%81%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C%E6%BC%8F%E6%B4%9E.md","https://github.com/peiqiF4ck/WebFrameworkTools-5.5-enhance","https://github.com/soltanali0/CVE-2025-53770-Exploit","https://github.com/MuhammadWaseem29/CVE-2025-53770","https://github.com/hazcod/CVE-2025-53770","https://nvd.nist.gov/vuln/detail/CVE-2025-53770"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2025/POC-AVE-2025-0100.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2025/AVE-2025-0100.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2025-0144","file_name":"2025/AVE-2025-0144.toml","cve_id":"无","title":"某企业Web应用存在未指定安全漏洞","description":"该漏洞来自HWPOC漏洞数据源，是2025年收录的企业级Web应用安全漏洞。由于原始数据的厂商、产品名称与漏洞类型字段缺失（模板变量未填充），无法确定具体受影响的软件产品。此类漏洞通常涉及输入验证不严导致的注入、文件操作或权限绕过等问题，攻击者在未授权情况下可能造成数据泄露或服务异常。建议排查相关日志并及时关注厂商安全公告获取修复方案。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["HWPOC-2025-01fe5e9d"],"sources":["hwpoc"],"published":"2025-07-20","updated":"2025-07-20","remediation":"建议联系软件厂商确认受影响产品并获取官方安全补丁，同时加强Web应用的输入验证与权限控制，部署WAF等安全防护措施，定期进行漏洞扫描与安全审计。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2025-07-20T08:00:00Z","references":[],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2025/AVE-2025-0144.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2025-0301","file_name":"2025/AVE-2025-0301.toml","cve_id":"无","title":"锐捷 EWEB 路由器任意文件读取漏洞","description":"锐捷 EWEB 路由器 ipam.php 接口存在任意文件读取漏洞，攻击者可在未授权状态下通过构造特制的 HTTP 请求参数，读取服务器上的任意文件，如配置文件、敏感数据等。该漏洞影响多款锐捷 EWEB 系列路由器产品，攻击条件低，无需身份认证即可远程利用，可能导致敏感信息泄露，危害较大。目前官方尚未发布正式补丁。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["HWPOC-2025-053b1579"],"sources":["hwpoc"],"published":"2025-07-18","updated":"2025-07-18","remediation":"及时联系锐捷官方获取EWEB系统固件更新补丁，升级至修复该漏洞的最新版本；如暂无法升级，建议在网络边界配置访问控制策略，限制对ipam.php等敏感接口的未授权访问，同时关闭非必要的EWEB管理页面对外暴露。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-21T00:00:00Z","references":[],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2025/AVE-2025-0301.toml"}]